{
  "info": {
    "name": "Greenwave — DVR Review & Queries (App)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Executive app APIs for the DVR admin review (verification + query thread).\n\n**Flow**\n1. Admin raises a query from the admin panel → DVR `query_status` = `Query Raised`, employee gets an email.\n2. App shows a badge from `review_query_unread` in the DVR list.\n3. Employee opens the chat → **Get Query Thread** (clears the badge).\n4. Employee replies → **Respond to Query** → `query_status` = `Query Responded`, admins on the thread get an email.\n\nOnly an admin can start a query. Verification (`dvr_status`) is done by the admin only; the app just displays it.\n\nSet the collection variables `base_url`, `token` (the executive's auth token, sent as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`) and `dvr_id`."
  },
