        "description": "Existing endpoint — unchanged URL and parameters. Each DVR now also carries:\n\n| Key | Type | Meaning |\n|---|---|---|\n| `dvr_status` | string | `Pending Verification` or `Verified` (admin review). DVRs created before this release are all `Verified`. |\n| `query_status` | string \\| null | `null` = no query; `Query Raised` = admin is waiting for the employee; `Query Responded` = employee has answered. |\n| `review_query_total` | int | Messages on the admin query thread. |\n| `review_query_unread` | int | Admin messages this employee has not opened yet — use for the badge. |\n| `can_respond_query` | bool | `true` once an admin has raised a query. Show the reply box only when true. |\n\nNote: `dvr_verified_date_time` is the old customer-contact OTP check and is unrelated to `dvr_status`."
      },
