        "description": "**NEW.** The admin query thread on one of the logged-in employee's own DVRs, oldest message first.\n\nOpening the thread marks the admin's messages as read, so `review_query_unread` on the list drops to 0 afterwards (call this when the employee opens the chat screen).\n\n- `can_post` — `false` until an admin has raised a query. The employee **cannot start** a query; show the reply box only when this is `true`.\n- `sender_type` — `admin` or `employee`; use it to place the bubble left/right.\n- `user_read` on an admin message — whether this employee has opened it.\n- `admin_read` on an employee message — whether an admin has seen the reply.\n\nErrors: `401` bad/missing token, `404` DVR not found or not this employee's."
      },
