        "description": "**NEW.** The employee answers the admin's query. Accepts form-data or JSON (`{\"message\": \"...\"}`).\n\nOnly allowed once an admin has raised a query (`can_post` / `can_respond_query` is `true`); otherwise `422`.\n\nOn success the DVR's `query_status` becomes **`Query Responded`** and every admin who has written on this thread is emailed. If an admin writes again, it goes back to `Query Raised`.\n\nErrors: `401` bad/missing token, `404` DVR not found or not this employee's, `422` empty message or no query to respond to."
      },
